     "text": "iCommunity Labs has had its own stand, being part of the official Spanish delegation. Program launched by ICEX and Red.es, from the Ministry of Economic Affairs and Digital Transformation. And it has been a perfect scenario to connect with new investors, strategic partners and potential clients and to present both the iBS platform, as well as the different products based on the blockchain certified registry."
