     "text": "It has been a great opportunity for quality networking, to present and make visible the technological advances and establish a lot of contacts of the highest level. Some of the main top crypto companies participating were: Socios.com, Trezor, Decentraland, The SandBox, Polygon, Polkadot and Binance, by the hand of its CEO Changpeng Zhao."
